  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "能源工程",
    "sub_ename": "ENERGY ENGINEERING",
    "describe_ch": "能源是萬物生存的要素，也是社會進步的動力，更和科技文明息息相?。本課先闡述能源的分類，再說明能源轉換的原理，進一步探討各種能源發電系統對環境的影響，並介紹太陽能系統、燃料電池及風力發電等發展的願景。",
    "describe_eh": "Energy is not only essential to our life but also important to our civilization, it especially contribute to the engineering. This course includes the classification of the energy, the principle of the energy conversion, the power generation and the environmental influences of energy applications. The solar energy system, fuel cells and wind energy also involved.",
